{"id":"ics-068","stemHtml":"<p>函数</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-c\">long f(long n, long a, long b, long c, long d, long e, long g, long h) {\n    long vla[n];        /* 变长数组 */\n    vla[0] = a + h;\n    return vla[0];\n}</code></pre></p>\n<p>的汇编开头是</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-text\">f:\n    pushq   %rbp\n    movq    %rsp, %rbp\n    movq    %rdi, %rax          # rax = n\n    salq    $3, %rax            # 8*n，long 占 8 字节\n    addq    $15, %rax\n    andq    $-16, %rax          # 向上取整到 16 的倍数\n    subq    %rax, %rsp          # 动态分配\n    movq    %rsp, %rcx          # vla 的起始地址\n    ...\n    leave\n    ret</code></pre></p>\n<p>(1) 8 个参数里哪些通过寄存器传递、哪些在栈上？第 7、8 个参数相对 <code>%rbp</code> 的偏移分别是多少？</p>\n<p>(2) 设进入 <code>f</code> 时 <code>%rbp = 0x7fffffffe000</code>。分别求 <code>n = 5</code> 与 <code>n = 3</code> 时 VLA 的起始地址和分配后的 <code>%rsp</code>。</p>\n<p>(3) 若调用者传入 <code>n = 2^{61}</code>，会发生什么？为什么写 <code>vla[1]</code> 可能直接改写返回地址？</p>\n<p>(4) <code>addq $15</code> 与 <code>andq $-16</code> 这一对指令在做什么？为什么栈帧大小必须是 16 的倍数？</p>\n<p>(5) 函数返回时用 <code>leave</code> 恢复现场，动态分配的 VLA 大小并不固定，<code>leave</code> 为什么还能正确恢复 <code>%rsp</code>？</p>\n","hintHtml":"<p>先数参数：整型/指针的前 6 个走寄存器，第 7 个起从右往左压栈，进入函数时栈顶是返回地址。VLA 的大小在运行期才确定，所以编译器用「乘元素大小、加 15、与 -16 相与」来算一个 16 字节对齐的字节数，再 <code>sub</code> 到 <code>%rsp</code>。</p>\n","solutionHtml":"<p><strong>(1)</strong> 前 6 个参数依次在 <code>%rdi</code>、<code>%rsi</code>、<code>%rdx</code>、<code>%rcx</code>、<code>%r8</code>、<code>%r9</code>，所以 <code>n</code>、<code>a</code>、<code>b</code>、<code>c</code>、<code>d</code>、<code>e</code> 走寄存器；第 7 个 <code>g</code>、第 8 个 <code>h</code> 由调用者压栈。</p>\n<p>进入函数时栈顶是返回地址，所以布局是：</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>地址</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td<code>0(%rbp)</code></td>\n<td>保存的旧 <code>%rbp</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td<code>8(%rbp)</code></td>\n<td>返回地址</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td<code>16(%rbp)</code></td>\n<td>第 7 个参数 <code>g</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td<code>24(%rbp)</code></td>\n<td>第 8 个参数 <code>h</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p><strong>为什么想到</strong>：先确认「函数入口时栈顶是返回地址、<code>push %rbp</code> 又占 8 字节」，再按参数顺序数到第 7 个，就能推出 16 和 24，不用死记。</p>\n<p><strong>(2)</strong> <code>n=5</code>：先算 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8n=40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span>，<code>addq $15</code> 得 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>55</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">55</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">55</span></span></span></span>，<code>andq $-16</code> 把低 4 位清零，得到 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>48</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">48</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">48</span></span></span></span>。于是</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mn>000</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\%rsp=0x7fffffffe000-48=0x7fffffffdfd0,</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9444em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">48</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">df</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>VLA 起点就是 <code>0x7fffffffdfd0</code>。</p>\n<code>n=3</code>：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8n=24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>39</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24+15=39</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">39</span></span></span></span>，向下对齐到 16 的倍数得 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">32</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mn>000</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mn>0.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\%rsp=0x7fffffffe000-32=0x7fffffffdff0.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9444em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">df</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">0.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>注意 24 本身不是 16 的倍数，所以要多留 8 字节填充；这就是 <code>addq $15</code> 的作用——先加上「最大填充」，再整体向下对齐，等价于向上取整。</p>\n<p><strong>(3)</strong> <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>61</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=2^{61}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">61</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，<code>salq $3</code> 计算 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>64</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8n=2^{64}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">64</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，在 64 位寄存器里按模 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>64</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{64}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">64</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 回绕成 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>。接着 <code>addq $15</code> 得 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span>，<code>andq $-16</code> 得 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>，于是 <code>subq $0</code>——<strong>没有分配任何栈空间</strong>，<code>%rsp</code> 仍等于 <code>%rbp</code>，VLA 起点也变成 <code>%rbp</code>。</p>\n<p>此时写 <code>vla[0]</code> 写到 <code>0(%rbp)</code>，覆盖保存的旧 <code>%rbp</code>；写 <code>vla[1]</code> 写到 <code>8(%rbp)</code>，正好覆盖返回地址。<code>leave</code> 时 <code>%rbp</code> 被破坏、<code>ret</code> 时跳到被改写的地址——典型的 VLA 大小溢出导致的栈破坏。C 标准里 VLA 大小在计算中溢出是未定义行为，编译器不会替你做检查。</p>\n<p>顺带一提，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> 也一样危险：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8n=-8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span>，加 15 得 7，对齐后为 0，同样不分配。</p>\n<p><strong>(4)</strong> 这一对指令做的是「把字节数向上取整到 16 的倍数」。对齐要求来自 ABI：执行 <code>call</code> 前 <code>%rsp</code> 必须满足 <code>%rsp % 16 = 0</code>。进入函数时 <code>%rsp % 16 = 8</code>，<code>pushq %rbp</code> 后变成 0，所以 <code>sub</code> 的量只要是 16 的倍数，后续调用其他函数时对齐仍然成立。</p>\n<p><strong>(5)</strong> <code>leave</code> 等价于</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-text\">movq %rbp, %rsp\npopq %rbp</code></pre></p>\n<p>它恢复的是<strong>帧基址</strong>而不是之前保存的 <code>%rsp</code> 值：<code>%rbp</code> 在函数开头就固定指向本帧的起点，VLA 无论分配了多大，<code>%rsp</code> 都可以直接拉回 <code>%rbp</code>。这也是为什么动态分配不需要额外保存旧 <code>%rsp</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>为什么想到</strong>：看到 <code>push rbp; mov rsp,rbp</code> 就知道 <code>%rbp</code> 是&quot;锚点&quot;；任何对 <code>%rsp</code> 的临时修改都可以在收尾时一次抹掉。</p>\n","mistakesHtml":"<p>一是把第 7、8 个参数算成 <code>8(%rbp)</code>、<code>16(%rbp)</code>，忘了 <code>8(%rbp)</code> 是返回地址。二是把 <code>andq $-16</code> 当成&quot;只清低 4 位、不改变大小&quot;，忽略它和 <code>addq $15</code> 配合才等于向上取整。三是以为 VLA 大小溢出时程序会崩溃或报错，实际上汇编照常执行、只是分配量为 0。四是认为 <code>leave</code> 能恢复 VLA 之前的 <code>%rsp</code> 是因为保存了旧值——它靠的是 <code>%rbp</code> 锚点。</p>\n","answerHtml":"<p>前 6 个参数在 rdi/rsi/rdx/rcx/r8/r9，第 7、8 个在 16(%rbp)、24(%rbp)；n=5 时 VLA 起点为 0x7fffffffdfd0；n=3 时为 0x7fffffffdff0；n=2^61 时分配量算成 0，VLA 起点回到 %rbp，vla[1] 正好是返回地址</p>\n"}